Plant data
----------
The plant database is built from sample data of IBM AssetOpsBench
(https://github.com/IBM/AssetOpsBench, branch main-0.x, commit
c6b96755b8a182aa090ee028852cbc83279b2982), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
The files are downloaded at build time (`shopfloor data`) and verified by SHA-256;
they are not redistributed in this repository.
